 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of a big big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Hamlet and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of Hamlet and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero.
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Hamlet.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Act III: കണക്കിന്റെ പ്രധാന ഘട്ടം.

Scene I: കണക്കിന്റെ ഉപഘട്ടം.
